# The openclaw image bakes only the entrypoint + Dockerfile from this
# directory. Every other asset reaches the running container at runtime
# via the /sandbox/dli bind mount (see openclaw_shell.entrypoint.sh).
# Keep the build context minimal. A small context means fewer rebuild
# triggers and no stale in-image copies of mutable assets.

# Ignore everything by default…
*

# …re-include only what the Dockerfile actually needs.
!openclaw_shell.Dockerfile
!openclaw_shell.entrypoint.sh
